100style_neutral_fw.csv is from The 100STYLE Dataset - Ian Mason
(https://ianxmason.github.io/100style/), licensed under CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). It is 20 s of Neutral/Neutral_FW.bvh
from frame 807, retargeted onto the Unitree G1 with GMR (gmr_plus) by
retarget_100style.py, at 30 fps.
